    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This delicate amulet looks like a tiny beating heart pierced with spikes. It has 3 charges and regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Whenever you deal damage to a creature, you can expend 1 charge to deal an extra 2d10 Necrotic damage to the target and force it to make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the target gains 1 Exhaustion level.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-gD8S0xhq7QsN7VsF\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Blood Price</em> inflige les 2d10 Necrotic quel que soit le jet ; sur un échec, ajoutez 1 niveau d’Épuisement à la cible à la main.</p></section>",
